    <l n="104" para="true">Ex his auibus <i>aquila</i> dicitur magna auis Ezech. 17. verf.3:</l>
    <l n="105">Quem enim inter quadrupedes gradum obtinet leo, eū-</l>
    <l n="106">dem inter aues aquila. Ea nidulatur altissimo loco Iob. 39.</l>
    <l n="107">v.30.31. nempe in saxis &amp; petris Obad. v. 4. videt acutissimè</l>
    <l n="108">&amp; longissimè Iob. 39. verf.32.33. est auis perniciosissima.</l>
    <l n="109">Thren. 4. v.19. volat altissimè. Esa. 40. v.30. in senectute</l>
    <l n="110">renouatur Psal. 103.v.5. quoniam non deficit senio aut æ-</l>
    <l n="111">gritudine, vt aliæ aues, sed semper, etiam in extremâ se-nectâ,</l>
